01:01:16.745 --> 01:01:19.560
This one also blew my mind.

01:01:19.560 --> 01:01:21.217
This is a 26-year-old woman.

01:01:21.217 --> 01:01:23.903
"My husband, who's 29,
is obsessed with my boss,

01:01:23.903 --> 01:01:27.861
"female who's 38, and it's all my fault."

01:01:27.861 --> 01:01:30.217
This comes from true off my chest.

01:01:30.217 --> 01:01:32.617
"I started this job about
one and a half years ago.

01:01:32.617 --> 01:01:35.017
"I can't say what it is because
I want us to stay anonymous

01:01:35.017 --> 01:01:36.217
"and our country is very small,

01:01:36.217 --> 01:01:38.197
"so my boss would probably be recognized.

01:01:38.197 --> 01:01:40.597
"The moment I started, I felt
like I was in the right place.

01:01:40.597 --> 01:01:43.447
"My boss, the owner of the
company, is very cool and kind.

01:01:43.447 --> 01:01:45.059
"She's self-made and she loves her job.

01:01:45.059 --> 01:01:46.927
"She does a lot of the dirty work herself

01:01:46.927 --> 01:01:49.837
"that bosses who have 30 to 35
employees wouldn't have to do

01:01:49.837 --> 01:01:51.007
"but she just loves it.

01:01:51.007 --> 01:01:52.750
"On top of that, we
have a six hour workday,

01:01:52.750 --> 01:01:55.087
"our salaries are 20%
higher than the market,

01:01:55.087 --> 01:01:57.787
"and we have seven paid
vacation weeks a year.

01:01:57.787 --> 01:01:58.837
"Her reasons?

01:01:58.837 --> 01:02:01.597
"She appreciates us and
she's getting richer anyway.

01:02:01.597 --> 01:02:03.547
"I was so proud of working
with a woman like her,

01:02:03.547 --> 01:02:05.917
"so I wouldn't shut up talking
about her to my husband,

01:02:05.917 --> 01:02:07.117
"especially in the beginning.

01:02:07.117 --> 01:02:09.397
"My husband was as
fascinated by her as I am

01:02:09.397 --> 01:02:11.917
"until he met her at a
company party last Christmas.

01:02:11.917 --> 01:02:13.837
"She must have been
beautiful when she was young.

01:02:13.837 --> 01:02:15.217
"She could have been a model.

01:02:15.217 --> 01:02:17.857
"I think his fascination
became a crush or an obsession

01:02:17.857 --> 01:02:19.357
"or maybe worse, love.

01:02:19.357 --> 01:02:21.487
"Now he follows her on social media.

01:02:21.487 --> 01:02:22.507
"Her accounts are private,

01:02:22.507 --> 01:02:24.307
"but he stalks her with my account.

01:02:24.307 --> 01:02:26.287
"He also follows the company Instagram

01:02:26.287 --> 01:02:28.057
"and likes every picture she's in.

01:02:28.057 --> 01:02:30.247
"He asks about her all the time.

01:02:30.247 --> 01:02:31.837
"She's a very private person,

01:02:31.837 --> 01:02:34.087
"but when her divorce from
her ex-husband was finalized

01:02:34.087 --> 01:02:35.317
"in the beginning of this year,

01:02:35.317 --> 01:02:37.837
"we all found out because he
started showing up to work.

01:02:37.837 --> 01:02:40.147
"He owned half of her company now

01:02:40.147 --> 01:02:41.737
"and he started to try to make changes

01:02:41.737 --> 01:02:43.038
"in our work hours and salaries.

01:02:43.038 --> 01:02:45.757
"We found out that her
husband had cheated on her

01:02:45.757 --> 01:02:46.597
"with a younger girl

01:02:46.597 --> 01:02:48.697
"who he also tried to
employ in our company.

01:02:48.697 --> 01:02:49.957
